  "prefLabel": "We 1001.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 1001.02 Applicability. We 1000 shall apply to complaints filed against water well contractors, pump installers, and any other individual authorized by these rules to perform pump repair or replacement.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17",
